    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AIREST\nSFO\nSAN FRANCISCO\nA-067\nDELTA\nIR LINES\nDAL\nDALLAS\n500-000\nAIR WEST\nand DELTA\nJet-Age Partners",
      "AIR\nWEST\nAir West Airlines\nAllegheny Airlines\nOzark Air Lines\nFrontier Airlines\nPIEDMONT\nAirlines\nPiedmont Airlines\nMohawk Airlines\nSouthern Airways\nALLa\nTrans Texas Airways\nNorth Central Airlines\nThe regional carriers and major trunk carriers of the\nUnited States combine to form a complex pattern of\ndependable airline transportation throughout our\nnation. This \"interline\" dependence results in close\ncooperation between all airlines... and all designed\nto serve you better.\nAt Delta Air Lines, the DELTAMATIC reserva-\ntions system can give instant confirmation not only\non Delta flights but on 25 other airlines as well.\nDELTAMATIC® keeps track of every seat on every\nDelta flight and on virtually all other domestic air-\nlines.\nThe same smooth harmony exists between Delta\nand its interline partners in ticketing procedures,\nbaggage handling, etc. Around the clock this close\nliaison between carriers is in evidence and your\nconnections are eased by it.\nThe next time you're \"connecting\"... connect\nto Delta and we'll show you what we mean!\nDELTA\nLAS VEGAS\nCHARLESTON\nEW ORLEANS\nDelta serves major U.S. cities border-to-border\nand coast-to-coast... thru the Gulf and Caribbean, too!\nDelta's wings\nspread across the most\npopular playgrounds\nof the western world\nPerhaps the ideal vacation for you is a week or two\nof fun on-the-go... or maybe you prefer just a\npleasant respite from the workaday world.\nSome\nwant vacation pleasure in a compact area... others\nlike to wander through unexplored avenues of ad-\nventure.\nWhatever you want in a vacation, you'll find it\nalong the Jet routes of Delta. Make it magic Florida\nfor gaiety 'round the clock... or relax with a bit\nmore elbow room in the tropic resort facilities of the\nBahamas and the Caribbean.\nThe fabulous west\ncoast of America is a tourist's delight and only a Jet\nhop away from your door step. The fast action of Las\nVegas, the Vieux Carre of New Orleans, all the facili-\nties and flavors of a nation are yours to enjoy in a\nthousand different ways... with as many different\nbudgets.\nAny Delta vacationland is just a quick hop away\nwhen you step aboard one of the many jets serving\ntoday's airline industry.\nDouglas Super DC-8 Jet-Newest in the\nDelta fleet, this is an elongated version of\nthe famed DC-8 FanJet. It measures 187\nfeet from nose to tail, yet lands in just\nover 30 lengths; seats 34 passengers in\nFirst Class, 161 in Jetourist.\nDouglas DC-8 FanJet-All Delta DC-8s\nhave FanJet engines for faster take-off\nand climb. The DC-8 was pioneered in\ncommercial service by Delta in 1959. It\naccommodates 36 passengers in First\nClass, and 99 in Jetourist.\nConvair 880 Jets-Delta was first to put\nthe 880 in commercial service in 1960.\nThis Jet holds the transcontinental speed\nrecord: San Diego to Miami in 3 hrs., 31\nmin., 54 sec. Seats 24 First Class, and 72\nJetourist passengers.\nDouglas DC-9 FanJet-Delta was first to\nfly this intermediate-range Jet in commer-\ncial service in 1965. The initial DC-9s\nseat 20 in\nFirst Class, 45 Tourist. New\ndeliveries of the longer model seat 24 in\nFirst Class, and 65 in Tourist."
    ],
